    <string name="mentra_miniapps_title">Mentra miniapps</string>
    <string name="mentra_miniapps_listening">A miniapp is listening for speech</string>
    <string name="mentra_miniapps_stop_all">Stop miniapps</string>
    <string name="mentra_miniapps_intro">Miniapps are small apps for smart glasses, built with Mentra\'s open SDK. CyanBridge runs them on the glasses you selected: text goes to their display, and they hear your phone or glasses microphone if you allow it. Features that need a Mentra account or Mentra\'s cloud (translation, photos, maps) are not available.</string>
    <string name="mentra_miniapps_trust_note">A miniapp is code from its publisher. Its sandbox cannot reach your files or other apps, but it can send what it hears or what you type into it to the internet. Install only miniapps you trust.</string>
